# Brief — CrewCut (6-film remake benchmark)

Source for every item: the `Benchmark objective` issue (steward#13), cited as **Obj §section/subsection**. Text in quotes is verbatim from it. Nothing here is changed, rounded or filled in; gaps are in "Gaps and maintainer decisions".

## 1. What the objective asks (requirements R1–R12)

- R1 "做出 6 部影片的基准数据和任务包" (Obj intro, §一).
- R2 "并用固定流水线在一部影片的任务上跑通、评分，证明任务包和评分能用" — Coffee Run, all tasks, 1 run each, T0 (Obj §二). "评测 coding agent 是下一轮的事."
